# Opening narration, before the tutorial fight.

narrator: Once upon a time, in a faraway land hidden within a forgotten realm...
narrator: There lived a very small rat with a very big heart.

join remi center

narrator: This is Remi, a small rat with an even bigger dream.
narrator: More than anything in the world, Remi dreamed of becoming the greatest dancer anyone had ever seen.
narrator: Every day, he practiced his steps, improved his moves, and imagined the day he would finally perform in front of everyone.
narrator: But there was only one small problem... Remi was, well... a rat.
narrator: Still, Remi kept practicing, hoping that one day he would get the chance to prove himself.
narrator: And now, that chance has finally arrived.
narrator: You, my friend, will guide Remi on his journey and help him achieve his dream.